        "bullets": [
          "Hatched sections are group holds: they count against capacity but are not sold until they convert",
          "Choose **Sells out** or **Soft demand** below the step controls; both end on the same revenue recap, folded from their own path",
          "Price and revenue modes recolour the same sections; the legend states the rule each time"
